      "rect" : [
        249.36052000000001,
        580.41934479999975,
        153.25151440000002,
        11.979110399999968
      ],
      "text" : "??? Binomials do not match!"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960219999999993,
        533.01934479999977,
        425.17512708528642,
        11.979110399999968
      ],
      "text" : "Because we did not use the negative sign with the six to find our pair of numbers,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960219999999993,
        518.37954479999974,
        425.21278882583039,
        11.979110399999968
      ],
      "text" : "the binomials did not match and grouping was not able to work at the end. Now"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960219999999993,
        503.73934479999969,
        180.13282174469128,
        11.979110399999968
      ],
      "text" : "the problem will be done correctly."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960219999999993,
        459.35129999999964,
        79.690012177763833,
        11.955199999999991
      ],
      "text" : "Example 289."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        201.00022000000001,
        412.46310799999969,
        55.897877999999992,
        21.774884499999985
      ],
      "text" : "x2 +5x− 6"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        272.52015,
        412.46310799999969,
        161.01821800000005,
        21.774884499999985
      ],
      "text" : "Want to multiply to− 6, add to 5"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        180.84032000000005,
        394.82330799999971,
        76.058048000000014,
        21.774494500000003
      ],
      "text" : "x2 +6x− x− 6"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        272.52548812800006,
        394.82330799999971,
        154.23158087398411,
        21.774494500000003
      ],
      "text" : "6and− 1, split the middle term"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        161.52039000000013,
        377.06310799999972,
        95.28516172211198,
        20.455347200000006
      ],
      "text" : "x(x + 6)− 1(x +6)"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        272.52035000000012,
        377.06310799999972,
        94.167121164953642,
        20.455347200000006
      ],
      "text" : "Factor by grouping"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        186.96055000000013,
        359.42330799999974,
        150.14362114864639,
        20.455347200000006
      ],
      "text" : "(x +6)(x− 1) Our Solution"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960330000000113,
        320.61944479999971,
        425.22217525783043,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "You may have noticed a shortcut for factoring these problems. Once we identify"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960330000000113,
        305.85964479999973,
        425.22056849402884,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "the two numbers that are used to split the middle term, these are the two num-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960330000000113,
        291.21944479999974,
        425.20151300710404,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "bers in our factors! In the previous example, the numbers used to split the middle"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960330000000113,
        268.10340799999977,
        425.18387902661129,
        20.455347200000006
      ],
      "text" : "term were 6 and− 1, our factors turned out to be (x + 6)(x− 1). This pattern"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.9598900000002,
        261.81944479999976,
        425.1571065126144,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "does not always work, so be careful getting in the habit of using it. We can use it"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.9598900000002,
        247.17964479999978,
        389.79174840999997,
        13.298257699999965
      ],
      "text" : "however, when we have no number (technically we have a 1) in front of x2"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        474.71951000000018,
        247.17964479999978,
        35.411644440320003,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : ". In all"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.959510000000193,
        232.41944479999978,
        425.25468452403203,
        13.298647700000004
      ],
      "text" : "the problems we have factored in this lesson there is no number in front of x2. If"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.959630000000232,
        217.77964479999974,
        425.21502609917439,
        11.979110399999996
      ],
      "text" : "this is the case then we can use this shortcut. This is shown in the next few"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.959630000000232,
        203.13984479999976,
        50.051935254784013,
        11.979110399999996
      ],
      "text" : "examples."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.959630000000232,
        158.75179999999975,
        79.690012226780198,
        11.955199999999991
      ],
      "text" : "Example 290."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        173.63933000000026,
        120.90173919999974,
        10.952438410000013,
        12.736363300000008
      ],
